    "One country total differs from Figure 3.1-4 (p.15): this parse gives Norway 27 facilities where that figure says 26. The difference comes from the source, not the parse — Norway carries both a 'Havstjerne Storage' entry (advanced development) and a 'Wintershall Dea Havstjerne' entry (early development), which the summary figure appears to treat as a single project. The United States (276), United Kingdom (65), Canada (58) and China (25) all reconcile exactly. The residual is left visible rather than adjusted to match.",
