    "Petrobras Santos Basin is listed at 10.6 Mtpa capture capacity (p.57) but the regional chapter reports 13 Mt injected during 2023 (p.38) — injection includes reinjected produced CO2, so it can exceed capture capacity.",
    "National strategy status is available for Europe only (Figure 4.4-1). Asia-Pacific, the Americas and the Middle East have substantial CCS legislation described in prose (Japan's CCS Business Act, South Korea's CCUS Act, Indonesia's Presidential Regulation 14/2024, Brazil's Fuels of the Future law) but the report applies no comparable published/in-preparation classification to them, so none is invented here."
